&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE openQueryCampanha DBOProgram 
PROCEDURE openQueryCampanha :
/*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Purpose:     
  Parameters:  <none>
  Notes:       
------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
   OPEN QUERY {&QueryName} FOR EACH {&TableName} NO-LOCK
                              WHERE {&TableName}.cod-campanha = icod-campanha.
   
   RETURN "OK":U.

END PROCEDURE.

